e, an output description or \\\"*\\\".\\nThe latter can be used to match any output.\\n\\nOn\\n{manpage}`sway(1)`,\\noutput names and descriptions can be obtained via\\n`swaymsg -t get_outputs`.\\n\",\"loc\":[\"services\",\"kanshi\",\"profiles\",\"<name>\",\"outputs\",\"*\",\"criteria\"],\"readOnly\":false,\"type\":\"string\"},\"services.kanshi.profiles.<name>.outputs.*.mode\":{\"declarations\":[{\"name\":\"<home-manager/modules/services/kanshi.nix>\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/nix-community/home-manager/blob/release-26.05/modules/services/kanshi.nix\"}],\"default\":{\"_type\":\"literalExpression\",\"text\":\"null\"},\"description\":\"&lt;width&gt;x&lt;height&gt;[@&lt;rate&gt;[Hz]]\\n\\nConfigures the specified output to use the specified mode.\\nModes are a combination of width and height (in pixels) and\\na refresh rate (in Hz) that your display can be configured to use.\\n\",\"example\":{\"_type\":\"literalExpression\",\"text\":\"\\\"1920x1080@60Hz\\\"\"},\"loc\":[\"services\",\"kanshi\",\"profiles\",\"<name>\",\"outputs\",\"*\",\"mode\"],\"readOnly\":false,\"type\":\"null or string\"},\"services.kanshi.profiles.<name>.outputs.*.position\":{\"declarations\":[{\"name\":\"<home-manager/modules/services/kanshi.nix>\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/nix-community/home-manager/blob/release-26.05/modules/services/kanshi.nix\"}],\"default\":{\"_type\":\"literalExpression\",\"text\":\"null\"},\"description\":\"&lt;x&gt;,&lt;y&gt;\\n\\nPlaces the output at the specified position in the global coordinates\\nspace.\\n\",\"example\":{\"_type\":\"literalExpression\",\"text\":\"\\\"1600,0\\\"\"},\"loc\":[\"services\",\"kanshi\",\"profiles\",\"<name>\",\"outputs\",\"*\",\"position\"],\"readOnly\":false,\"type\":\"null or string\"},\"services.kanshi.profiles.<name>.outputs.*.scale\":{\"declarations\":[{\"name\":\"<home-manager/modules/services/kanshi.nix>\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/nix-community/home-manager/blob/release-26.05/modules/services/kanshi.nix\"}],\"default\":{\"_t